msgid ""
"Contrôle du bruit : off, cancellation, awareness ou next (pour un raccourci "
"clavier)"
msgstr ""
"Noise control: off, cancellation, awareness or next (for a keyboard "
"shortcut)"

#: sirene/app.py:304
msgid ""
"Le canal des écouteurs ne répond pas, ou un autre programme l'occupe "
"(OpenFreebuds, MyBuds…). Fermez-le, puis réessayez."
msgstr ""
"The earphones' channel does not answer, or another program is using it "
"(OpenFreebuds, MyBuds…). Close it, then try again."

